'''Nasty Notice''' (Japanese: '''いじわるレター''' ''Mean Letter'') is an {{TCGP|Item}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Mega Shine}} expansion.

==Card text==
{{TCGTrainerText
|class=Item
|rule=SWSH Item
|effect=You opponent discards cards from their hand until they have 4 cards in their hand.
}}

==Trivia==
*This card's effect is identical to the {{TCG|Ability|Abilities}} Scornful Storm on {{TCG ID|Dragon Vault|Salamence|8}} from {{TCG|Dragon Vault}} or Wicked Ruler on {{TCG ID|Champion's Path|Galarian Obstagoon|37}} from {{TCG|Champion's Path}}.
